Features:
1. IP Lookup
2. Domain Lookup
3. Port Scanner
4. DNS Lookup
5. OSINT Search
6. System Info
7. Ping Test
8. Header Grabber
9. SSL Checker
10. Subdomain Finder
11. Username Search
12. Directory Bruteforce
13. Exit

Requirements:
- Use Python 3
- Modular structure:
  /core
  /modules
  /utils
  main.py
- Each feature in separate module file
- Use OOP where needed
- CLI menu with color (colorama or rich)
- Each option has unique color
- Clean banner/logo (ASCII art)
- Error handling for invalid input
- Works on Linux terminal
- No heavy dependencies

Include:
- requirements.txt
- Example usage
- Comments for each module

Keep code clean, minimal, and production-ready.